  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1502.41 NHEnviro",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1502.41 “NHEnviro” means an online portal available on the department’s website at https://nhenviro.des.nh.gov through which applicants are required to submit all documents and forms related to an AOT permit application and through which the department communicates with applicants and their agents.\n\nSource. #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36",
